WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.363
Before you start sending applications, get

2
00:00:02.363 --> 00:00:03.867
clear on what you're working with.

3
00:00:04.301 --> 00:00:07.762
That means understanding your immediate situation, identifying

4
00:00:07.762 --> 00:00:09.493
the strengths and accomplishments you can bring

5
00:00:09.493 --> 00:00:11.520
to an employer, and thinking about the

6
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.102
people already in your network.

7
00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:14.871
You may already have some of

8
00:00:14.871 --> 00:00:17.413
this information from earlier BOOST activities.

9
00:00:18.105 --> 00:00:20.409
Now we're going to turn it into action.
